GCC 14.2.0-19 / Clang 19.1.7 / EvoCC, O0/O2, reference and mixed archives:
12 native executions, 48 rounding-mode observations, all exit 0 and have
identical complete output. This PASS means the diagnostic controls agree,
NOT that powf passes its unchanged upstream test.

